        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The dark shadowy figure we see in current Tactics art is certainly none other than Gloomweaver in the form of our dearly dead Dr. Medico.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Which card(s) is that?</p>",
