        "created_at": "2017-04-12T00:57:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Phantom5613\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/48/1906_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Phantom5613:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Someone needs to finish up Adam’s song and set it up to rag-time music. This is a thing that NEEDS to exist, you guys.Also, I am looking forward to the next big expansion for Tactics after Prime War:Thirty Times Hot-Dog Face and the relish of Gloom</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Featuring Mustard Man, the Ketchup King, and not shockingly a third iteration of the Operative where all of her poisons become Mayo</p>",
