        "cooked": "<p>I am excited my Question made it to the podcast! The realm of discord is just a darker Fey realm, awesome. So I wonder if there is a happier Realm of Discord in an other dimention. That woukld be my kind of place.</p><p>I should have added a line in my question pointing out that Baron Blade and Legacy got in the RoD in at the end of Vengance. How did hey get there. It is always Nightmist who takes him there. And does Wraith Hairdrier always comes alive when she steps into the RoD?</p><p>Now if you guys would be so kind to do an interlude of The Void very soon. That would make me happy. This can help explain promo Akash', promo La Comadora, Promo Nightmist, the Rifts of Time, The Viturous of the Void and all those who proceeded him. The best thing you guys waid that it is connected to every dimentions (so there is only 1 void) and that it is nowhere and nowhen.</p><p>So how is the Foley Artist hiring coming along? It also sounds like Adam will need a full band to&nbsp;accompany him while he sings. I see Trevor started to add special affects too, keep it up.</p>",
