        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-12T14:15:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Chogb001\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Chogb001:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I think he's talking about the comic in Uprising where Operative, Proletariot, and Ambu ( I think I dont have access to our groups tactics box =( ) report to a shadowy figure. I always figured it was the chairman but considering Chairman in Tactics is Exemplar and a bit on the murder-ish side I think it is someone else… I imagine that Gloomweaver just looks like his skinwalker version but pretty much pure energy… so shadows dont exactly work =P</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>No. I'm not talking about that.</p>\n<p>I'm talking about the shadowy figure thats squeezing the life out of the Seer</p>\n<p>Although now that I went back and took a look at the card, I might be wrong. It's probably just a Spite clone.</p>",
